      "content": "6.1 Tribal Demography"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Tribal Demography provides foundational statistical insights into Chhattisgarh's indigenous population.",
        "Major Tribes form the core demographic and socio-cultural fabric of the state.",
        "PVTGs (Particularly Vulnerable Tribal Groups) require specialized study regarding their protection and status.",
        "The Ghotul System represents an essential traditional social institution unique to specific tribal communities.",
        "Tribal Revolts & Movements reflect historical resistance, land rights struggles, and leadership in Chhattisgarh."
